* official Analog Canvas netlist; PDK X cards rewritten by convert.py
.model nch nmos
.model pch pmos

.subckt dut VDD VSS VREF VB3 IBUF VIN VOUT VB2 VB1
CL VOUT net11 1p
M1 net9 net9 VDD VDD pch l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
